        {
          "text": "na mbee wa maũndũ onthe ĩthĩwai mũkyendana mũno na wendo mũvyũ inyw’ĩ kwa inyw’ĩ; nũndũ wendo nũvw’ĩkaa wingĩ wa naĩ: ",
